WEBVTT

00:07.780 --> 00:08.620
<i>Ta-da!</i>

00:09.240 --> 00:10.200
<i>Ta-da!</i>

00:10.440 --> 00:12.160
<i>Ta-daaa!</i>

00:16.870 --> 00:19.580
<i>I haven't forgotten anything!</i>

00:23.460 --> 00:25.320
Please be careful.

00:25.320 --> 00:27.490
We will. Thank you for everything.

00:27.910 --> 00:31.950
<i>The protective pendant and knife 
I received on my birthday...</i>

00:31.950 --> 00:35.920
<i>I didn't think I'd be using them so soon!</i>

00:34.490 --> 00:36.670
I'll put them in my bunny bag.

00:39.650 --> 00:40.830
Cheep!

00:41.920 --> 00:42.770
Cheep.

00:42.770 --> 00:43.920
Nox!

00:43.920 --> 00:45.010
Cheep.

00:46.150 --> 00:48.530
I'll be counting on you as our lookout.

00:48.530 --> 00:49.100
Cheep.

00:49.590 --> 00:52.080
We don't know when we'll run into monsters.

00:52.420 --> 00:54.600
Stay on your guard, everyone.

00:54.600 --> 00:55.520
Yes, sir!

00:55.520 --> 00:58.760
<i>All right, let's march right into that forest!</i>

00:58.760 --> 01:00.320
Cheep!

01:11.840 --> 01:16.680
<b><i>Fluffy Paradise</i></b>

02:33.290 --> 02:38.300
<b><i>Episode 5   Surprised by the Monsters in the Forest!</i></b>

02:36.960 --> 02:39.420
I spotted the monsters right up here.

02:39.670 --> 02:43.710
I've been hunting in this area for decades,

02:43.710 --> 02:46.390
but I've never seen anything 
like this before.

02:46.790 --> 02:50.340
<i>We're definitely on a game trail. 
This forest is really deep, too.</i>

02:50.740 --> 02:53.320
<i>She's watching out for us from above, but...</i>

02:56.540 --> 02:58.950
All right. Let's take a break here.

02:58.950 --> 03:02.130
We have some packed lunches from the mayor.

03:02.130 --> 03:04.230
I'm hungry!

03:05.520 --> 03:06.870
Please stand back.

03:21.400 --> 03:23.010
It's just a rabbit!

03:29.370 --> 03:32.090
<i>A-A rabbit?! That furball's a rabbit?</i>

03:32.390 --> 03:33.780
My lady...

03:33.780 --> 03:35.060
Are you okay?

03:35.520 --> 03:39.010
<i>Actually, it's not moving at all.
 I wonder what's wrong.</i>

03:39.480 --> 03:40.310
Ah!

03:41.180 --> 03:44.910
<i>I-It ran away! From </i>me<i>?!</i>

03:41.200 --> 03:44.910
<b>S
H
O
C
K</b>

03:45.570 --> 03:48.210
My lady, let's get away from here.

03:48.210 --> 03:49.360
Huh?

03:49.360 --> 03:52.870
Monsters lured here by the scent
of blood are bound to be vicious.

03:54.590 --> 03:57.500
<i>That little guy must've been hurt!</i>

03:58.200 --> 04:01.300
We didn't come here to 
exterminate the monsters,

04:01.300 --> 04:03.740
so we should do all we can to avoid them.

04:04.600 --> 04:05.650
My lady!

04:05.940 --> 04:06.630
Neema!

04:07.000 --> 04:09.750
<i>I'm sorry. I know I shouldn't do this...</i>

04:09.750 --> 04:13.070
<i>But I can't leave that little 
creature alone if it's hurt!</i>

04:15.530 --> 04:17.570
<i>I wonder where it went.</i>

04:21.920 --> 04:23.030
There you are!

04:23.740 --> 04:24.900
Come here, little one!

04:35.240 --> 04:38.460
<i>Wait, what? It's so tame now!</i>

04:38.460 --> 04:40.390
<i>How cute!</i>

04:40.390 --> 04:41.900
<i>Oh, of course.</i>

04:41.900 --> 04:45.230
<i>It must have been running
 from the knights earlier.</i>

04:46.030 --> 04:48.550
<i>Sorry we scared you.</i>

04:49.930 --> 04:54.530
<i>I guess I haven't lost my floofing 
powers after all. Thank goodness!</i>

04:54.790 --> 04:57.950
Okay, let's head back and 
get you fixed right up.

04:58.820 --> 05:00.900
I wonder if that's Father and the others.

05:02.560 --> 05:05.020
Wh-What the?!

05:09.230 --> 05:11.030
Th-This is...

05:13.440 --> 05:14.920
Ow, ow, ow...

05:21.380 --> 05:23.830
<i>Something's there...?</i>

05:26.150 --> 05:28.260
<i>And a lot of them!</i>

05:31.820 --> 05:33.140
<i>A goblin?!</i>

05:34.560 --> 05:36.790
<i>I think...</i>

05:37.420 --> 05:39.690
<i>I might actually be in big trouble!</i>

05:42.360 --> 05:44.320
Don't eat it!

05:47.440 --> 05:49.230
<i>It understood me?</i>

05:49.230 --> 05:53.040
<i>Huh? Why are you sad all of a sudden?</i>

05:53.040 --> 05:55.220
<i>Where'd all that intimidation go?</i>

05:57.490 --> 06:01.120
Why did you kidnap me? 
What do you plan to do with me?

06:06.500 --> 06:09.380
<i>Th-They're actually cute!</i>

06:09.810 --> 06:11.510
<i>No, no. They're monsters, duh.</i>

06:19.210 --> 06:22.260
There are several goblin tracks.

06:22.260 --> 06:24.720
I believe they're what took Lady Nefertima.

06:25.020 --> 06:27.700
It could be a fairly large horde.

06:28.140 --> 06:31.910
<i>Unbelievable... How could 
this happen with me here?</i>

06:37.170 --> 06:38.880
Huh? Here?

06:44.210 --> 06:45.250
<i>H...</i>

06:46.250 --> 06:48.090
<i>Humans!</i>

06:49.570 --> 06:53.120
Um... Did you get kidnapped, too?

06:53.120 --> 06:54.720
Yes, I did.

06:54.720 --> 06:56.280
You two as well?

06:56.280 --> 06:59.930
Isn't it obvious? 
That's clearly why we're here.

07:00.360 --> 07:02.890
<i>Yeesh. Well, she's got a point.</i>

07:03.320 --> 07:06.860
<i>She's harsher than she looks.</i>

07:07.110 --> 07:09.830
I'm Neema. It's nice to meet you.

07:10.090 --> 07:13.790
I'm Pino. This is my little sister, Nino.

07:14.060 --> 07:16.190
Are you the only ones here?

07:16.190 --> 07:18.090
Well, there're some adults...

07:18.090 --> 07:19.000
Adults?

07:19.270 --> 07:21.320
They got taken with us.

07:21.320 --> 07:25.470
But they're being held somewhere else,
 so we haven't seen them since.

07:25.770 --> 07:29.840
<i>Hmm, this would be better
 if I were alone, but...</i>

07:29.840 --> 07:33.880
<i>Say, Sol, would it be dangerous to 
use fire magic in an enclosed space?</i>

07:33.880 --> 07:35.480
<i>Would we be able to breathe?</i>

07:35.950 --> 07:37.430
Where did this come from?

07:37.780 --> 07:41.820
<i>Some goblins kidnapped me,
 and I'm stuck in a cave.</i>

07:41.820 --> 07:43.360
Honestly, you're so...

07:43.360 --> 07:45.520
<i>It wasn't on purpose!</i>

07:45.520 --> 07:49.080
<i>Anyway, I'd like to escape 
with some other people.</i>

07:49.080 --> 07:53.410
<i>I was wondering if you could use 
your magic to teach the goblins a lesson.</i>

07:56.050 --> 07:58.980
You'd be able to breathe
 if we channeled wind,

07:58.980 --> 08:01.610
but I cannot attack just the goblins.

08:01.610 --> 08:04.330
Perhaps if you can adjust your magic...

08:04.330 --> 08:07.370
<i>Yeah, that's not happening. 
I don't have any magical power!</i>

08:07.370 --> 08:08.090
Neema?

08:08.090 --> 08:09.790
Oh, sorry.

08:10.250 --> 08:13.690
<i>I guess we'll just have 
to wait for Papa to save us.</i>

08:15.300 --> 08:17.720
<b>Gurgle</b>

08:17.990 --> 08:20.170
Seriously? You're unbelievable.

08:20.430 --> 08:24.960
I-I can't help it! You can get 
hungry at any time, you know!

08:26.230 --> 08:27.980
Well, well, well!

08:27.980 --> 08:30.290
Y-You've got the wrong idea! This is just...

08:31.260 --> 08:32.750
I get it.

08:32.750 --> 08:35.920
You always get hungry when 
you're deep in thought, huh?

08:35.920 --> 08:39.350
Th-That's right! I was thinking 
about lots of stuff!

08:39.350 --> 08:40.260
Yeah, sure.

08:40.260 --> 08:41.150
Honest!

08:41.150 --> 08:41.920
Yeah, sure.

08:41.920 --> 08:43.530
It's the truth, dang it!

08:45.500 --> 08:48.230
<i>I never did get to eat my packed lunch...</i>

08:48.460 --> 08:49.160
Oh?

08:50.620 --> 08:51.910
<i>We might be able to get out.</i>

08:52.630 --> 08:55.050
I'm gonna go look for some food.

08:55.050 --> 08:55.620
Huh?

08:55.620 --> 08:56.630
Take care of this guy.

08:56.890 --> 08:58.140
You're going by yourself?

08:58.140 --> 08:59.380
That's dangerous!

08:59.380 --> 09:02.000
Yeah, I'll be fine. Just wait here.

09:16.710 --> 09:19.570
I'm sorry, I'm sorry! I was startled, too!

09:20.740 --> 09:25.590
Um, we're hungry. 
Do you have anything to eat?

09:31.420 --> 09:32.680
<i>Fruit?</i>

09:32.680 --> 09:34.480
Can I eat this?

09:36.650 --> 09:38.620
<i>I wonder if it's edible...</i>

09:41.180 --> 09:44.520
<i>That's bitter!</i>

09:44.520 --> 09:47.480
<i>What is this? My tongue feels all tingly!</i>

09:56.050 --> 09:58.610
<i>I wonder if it'll be okay this time...</i>

10:02.890 --> 10:05.130
I-It's so sweet!

10:05.130 --> 10:07.000
I guess I wasn't supposed to eat the skin!

10:07.310 --> 10:08.650
<i>This is yummy.</i>

10:08.650 --> 10:11.550
<i>Pino and Nino should be 
able to eat this, too.</i>

10:12.010 --> 10:13.960
Could I get a few more?

10:15.670 --> 10:17.800
This many? Thank you!

10:19.040 --> 10:21.640
<i>How do I get the skin off?</i>

10:21.970 --> 10:22.760
<i>I know!</i>

10:22.760 --> 10:24.630
Ta-da!

10:35.930 --> 10:37.640
Yes, very good!

10:38.160 --> 10:40.870
Now you'll be able to eat these easier, too.

10:40.870 --> 10:42.110
Let's peel some more!

10:43.080 --> 10:45.070
<i>And so, before I knew it...</i>

10:45.440 --> 10:47.970
<i>We all became friends.</i>

10:48.790 --> 10:53.180
<i>To think the power I received from God 
works on monsters, too!</i>

10:53.740 --> 10:59.520
<i>But this isn't good. I don't want 
to see any of them exterminated.</i>

10:59.840 --> 11:04.930
<i>Papa's definitely coming here, 
and I doubt he'll listen to me.</i>

11:05.770 --> 11:09.530
Say, why do you all live here?

11:12.720 --> 11:15.980
Sorry. I don't know what you're saying.

11:18.050 --> 11:19.980
It sure is rowdy out there.

11:19.980 --> 11:21.990
<i>Did Papa come for...</i>

11:28.920 --> 11:32.880
<i>I-It's huge! Is he one of 
those hobgoblin things?</i>

11:33.770 --> 11:36.720
What's a human girl doing here?

11:36.720 --> 11:38.170
<i>I-It can talk?!</i>

11:38.650 --> 11:40.680
You kidnapped another one?

11:41.600 --> 11:44.140
How many times do I have 
to tell you to knock that off?

11:44.140 --> 11:45.590
Wait a second!

11:45.910 --> 11:47.750
I have some questions for you!

11:48.590 --> 11:52.520
First, is it safe to assume 
you're their leader?

11:53.030 --> 11:53.860
Yes.

11:53.860 --> 11:56.220
<i>Hey, we can actually have a conversation!</i>

11:56.460 --> 12:00.430
Second, why do they keep 
kidnapping kids like me?

12:00.920 --> 12:03.140
That's just in their nature.

12:03.520 --> 12:05.120
Their nature?

12:05.460 --> 12:08.310
I'd say they're protecting you
rather than kidnapping you.

12:08.310 --> 12:13.090
Goblins take very good care of children, 
even if they're human children.

12:13.410 --> 12:18.410
<i>I see. Although it wasn't like 
I was lost or anything.</i>

12:18.410 --> 12:20.550
Okay, here's my third and final question.

12:21.030 --> 12:23.020
Why do you attack humans?

12:25.360 --> 12:26.430
To survive.

12:29.300 --> 12:33.840
That's the only reason we came this far.

12:35.410 --> 12:39.580
But I heard that there weren't any 
goblins in this forest before.

12:39.580 --> 12:43.880
Is there a reason you had 
to leave your former nest?

12:44.820 --> 12:46.870
We were chased out of our forest...

12:46.870 --> 12:47.800
by humans.

12:47.800 --> 12:48.750
Huh?

12:49.200 --> 12:54.590
And not just us goblins. 
The kobolds, orcs, and ogres, too.

12:54.590 --> 12:56.700
But why'd you come this far north?

12:56.700 --> 12:59.850
The humans just kept pursuing us.

12:59.850 --> 13:04.690
Those who weren't willing to fight or
 couldn't take the cold perished one by one.

13:04.690 --> 13:07.380
We're weak, so we kept running,

13:07.380 --> 13:09.690
but even so, many of us fell.

13:11.890 --> 13:15.400
<i>So basically, this is all humans' fault?</i>

13:15.400 --> 13:18.170
<i>I need Papa to look into what happened.</i>

13:19.170 --> 13:24.150
<i>But what am I going to about these guys?
 I can't just leave them alone...</i>

13:24.820 --> 13:26.150
<i>Hmm...</i>

13:27.070 --> 13:29.360
What do all of you want to do?

13:29.360 --> 13:31.750
Do you want revenge against the humans?

13:35.740 --> 13:38.620
We just want to go back 
to our old way of life.

13:38.620 --> 13:41.430
We want to hunt and be hunted 
alongside animals and monsters,

13:41.430 --> 13:43.790
and go back to being part of the forest.

13:44.330 --> 13:47.610
<i>A part of the forest, huh?</i>

13:48.990 --> 13:51.660
<i>He's talking as though they're prey.</i>

13:51.660 --> 13:55.550
<i>But goblins aren't 
from these woods to begin with,</i>

13:55.550 --> 13:58.760
<i>so if they settle here, 
it'd upset the ecosystem.</i>

13:59.640 --> 14:02.680
<i>If we could just get them and the other</i>

14:02.680 --> 14:04.730
<i>displaced creatures
to live in the same spot...</i>

14:05.130 --> 14:07.200
Hey, how about this? You see...

14:08.110 --> 14:12.170
Whisper, whisper...

14:12.670 --> 14:14.440
She sure is taking a long time.

14:14.440 --> 14:15.290
Are you worried?

14:15.290 --> 14:16.970
O-Of course I'm not!

14:18.670 --> 14:21.080
Hmm, that's certainly an interesting thought.

14:21.410 --> 14:22.540
Right?

14:23.060 --> 14:26.000
So it's all right to kill the humans?

14:27.010 --> 14:29.660
Well, it's survival of the fittest.

14:29.660 --> 14:32.640
<i>At this rate, I can't ensure
the humans will survive,</i>

14:32.640 --> 14:34.990
<i>but it should work out
if we can form a contract.</i>

14:35.860 --> 14:37.850
Then that's not a bad idea.

14:37.850 --> 14:41.220
Even so, you'll have to get through today.

14:41.220 --> 14:41.940
Today?

14:41.940 --> 14:46.000
My father will probably be on the 
warpath coming to find me.

14:46.000 --> 14:48.910
If he makes it here, I don't know 
what he'll do to all of you.

14:49.180 --> 14:51.880
You could be wiped out
 before we find you somewhere to live!

14:53.030 --> 14:57.110
So we need to come up with a plan 
to make sure he'll listen to us.

14:57.110 --> 14:58.330
A plan?

14:58.630 --> 14:59.520
Yeah.

15:03.050 --> 15:05.750
Don't eat so fast. It's rude.

15:06.860 --> 15:08.020
Well...

15:08.020 --> 15:11.210
Don't worry. There's still plenty, 
so you don't have to hurry.

15:11.480 --> 15:15.180
Thanks. So, are we really going 
to be able to get out of here?

15:15.500 --> 15:19.320
Yes. The goblins said it was okay, too.

15:19.320 --> 15:24.520
My father should be nearby, 
so if we escape, he'll take care of us.

15:24.910 --> 15:28.060
That's great. We'll be able to go home.

15:28.060 --> 15:30.380
But why are we going outside?

15:30.380 --> 15:32.980
If help's on the way, 
shouldn't we wait here?

15:33.450 --> 15:37.740
You now understand that the goblins had 
their reasons for doing what they did, right?

15:37.740 --> 15:38.440
Yeah...

15:38.710 --> 15:40.910
I want to save them.

15:43.170 --> 15:47.850
But if my father is angry,
 he probably won't hear the goblins out.

15:48.160 --> 15:50.800
Yeah, no one would listen to monsters anyway.

15:51.100 --> 15:55.140
That's why I wanted to create a situation 
where they <i>have</i> to listen to us.

15:55.140 --> 15:58.130
So I need you two to help me.

15:59.070 --> 16:01.720
Would you mind being our decoy?

16:02.750 --> 16:04.190
Decoy?

16:04.450 --> 16:07.480
I want you to pretend like you're 
being chased by goblins.

16:07.480 --> 16:12.470
Then the ones assigned to protect 
you will be out of the fight.

16:12.470 --> 16:16.650
I think it'll be easier to talk
 if their numbers are lower.

16:19.080 --> 16:20.270
We can't do that.

16:20.270 --> 16:20.920
Huh?

16:20.920 --> 16:23.090
I can't put Nino in danger.

16:24.760 --> 16:26.450
I'll cast a protection spell on you.

16:29.380 --> 16:30.430
No.

16:30.430 --> 16:32.380
It's a really powerful spell, though!

16:32.700 --> 16:34.270
It's still a no.

16:34.270 --> 16:37.090
I don't want her to go 
through anything else scary.

16:38.790 --> 16:40.290
I'll do it.

16:41.570 --> 16:46.850
If we can play the decoy and your 
plan goes well, we'll all be saved, right?

16:47.270 --> 16:48.160
Yes.

16:48.520 --> 16:49.670
Nino...

16:51.210 --> 16:55.190
Neema's younger than both of us,
but she's doing this for all of us.

16:56.200 --> 16:57.160
Not to mention...

16:58.290 --> 17:00.110
She says we'll be safe.

17:00.420 --> 17:03.590
Neema would never lie to us, 
so we'll be fine.

17:05.050 --> 17:06.450
Nino!

17:06.450 --> 17:10.420
Hey! Stop being so gross! 
Quit being clingy!

17:12.790 --> 17:15.840
Okay. You're right, Nino.

17:15.840 --> 17:18.390
I'm sorry about that.
 I'll do what I can to help!

17:18.390 --> 17:20.840
Thanks, you two.

17:27.840 --> 17:30.380
The goblin nest is just ahead.

17:30.380 --> 17:31.570
Shall we go?

17:31.570 --> 17:35.600
Yes. But prioritize bringing
 Nefertima back safely.

17:35.600 --> 17:36.320
Yes, sir!

17:36.320 --> 17:38.400
No!

17:38.400 --> 17:40.280
Get away!

17:41.030 --> 17:42.150
Children?

17:42.150 --> 17:43.880
That's not Lady Nefertima.

17:45.220 --> 17:46.440
<i>Could it be...?</i>

17:47.070 --> 17:48.000
Capture them.

17:48.760 --> 17:49.680
But...

17:49.680 --> 17:50.300
Just do it.

17:50.760 --> 17:53.070
<i>Yes, very good!</i>

17:53.070 --> 17:56.250
<i>There's no way Papa would 
just abandon some kids!</i>

17:56.590 --> 17:58.320
Nino! This way!

17:58.320 --> 18:00.170
No!

17:59.200 --> 18:03.230
<i>Sol's magic is amazing!
I can hear their voices so clearly.</i>

18:03.230 --> 18:04.550
You two! Over here!

18:08.990 --> 18:12.360
<i>All right, that's enough!
You can all go back to the nest.</i>

18:15.200 --> 18:16.120
After them.

18:16.120 --> 18:16.880
Yes, sir!

18:19.910 --> 18:22.270
<i>All right. Everything's going as planned!</i>

18:22.640 --> 18:25.160
<i>Now they can't attack at will if they think</i>

18:25.160 --> 18:27.240
<i>other people might be inside.</i>

18:27.500 --> 18:32.970
<i>And when faced with a big, bad hobgoblin,
I'm sure they'll be willing to talk.</i>

18:39.110 --> 18:41.290
<i>Yes, this was the perfect plan!</i>

18:42.480 --> 18:43.760
It's huge...

18:44.220 --> 18:48.700
We'll return the children. Begone, humans.

18:48.700 --> 18:50.230
My.

18:50.520 --> 18:53.880
It's rare to encounter 
a goblin that can speak.

18:57.910 --> 18:59.360
<i>Yikes!</i>

18:59.790 --> 19:02.690
I'll have you return Nefertima to us.

19:02.690 --> 19:05.320
It's time for children to be in bed.

19:07.030 --> 19:08.670
<i>So scary! He's terrifying!</i>

19:08.670 --> 19:10.490
<i>That's not the papa I know!</i>

19:31.020 --> 19:32.760
I knew you were in there.

19:32.760 --> 19:34.690
Come out this instant, Nefertima!

19:34.690 --> 19:36.140
YIKES

19:36.140 --> 19:37.530
<i>He totally had me figured out!</i>

19:37.530 --> 19:40.610
<i>Maybe my best option is to just apologize...</i>

19:42.270 --> 19:45.590
You won't get mad? You won't use any magic?

19:45.870 --> 19:50.540
I will neither use magic nor get mad. 
You have my word.

19:56.440 --> 19:58.000
I'm sorry.

19:58.550 --> 20:01.720
I'm not exactly sure why you're apologizing,

20:01.720 --> 20:04.810
but hurry up and come over here
 to put me at ease.

20:09.320 --> 20:10.930
Father!

20:14.910 --> 20:16.320
Let's shoot a huge fireball.

20:16.320 --> 20:17.510
Three shots.

20:18.720 --> 20:20.440
Sol, protect them!

20:30.300 --> 20:31.660
I won't let you kill them!

20:32.020 --> 20:34.000
Why are you protecting the goblins?

20:34.240 --> 20:37.460
They were just used by the humans!

20:37.880 --> 20:38.920
Used?

20:38.920 --> 20:43.920
They were chased out by humans and 
had no choice but to end up here!

20:46.640 --> 20:50.090
Please, Father! Listen to what I have to say!

20:53.010 --> 20:56.070
Very well. If you insist, Neema.

20:57.820 --> 20:58.840
Really?

20:58.840 --> 20:59.460
Yes.

20:59.460 --> 21:00.510
Thank you!

21:02.560 --> 21:05.350
Pino, Nino, are you hurt?

21:05.730 --> 21:08.990
We're fine. You seem okay too, Neema.

21:09.250 --> 21:11.460
Isn't your father a bit too scary?

21:14.710 --> 21:15.930
Nox?

21:18.690 --> 21:21.190
<i>That cry is to let us know danger's nearby.</i>

21:25.080 --> 21:27.040
<i>Something's there...</i>

21:28.020 --> 21:31.550
<i>Most of the reports seem to be about goblins.</i>

21:31.550 --> 21:34.570
<i>There have also been reports of kobolds 
and, very rarely...</i>

21:35.220 --> 21:37.060
Sol, I need some light.

21:37.060 --> 21:38.160
Understood.

21:43.300 --> 21:44.520
Please stand back!

21:52.050 --> 21:52.950
Nino!

21:54.170 --> 21:55.440
That's...

21:57.370 --> 21:58.950
a frost spider!

23:34.970 --> 23:39.970
<b>Next Time</b>

23:34.970 --> 23:39.970
<b>The Desire to Become Stronger</b>
